<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Rockwell, Agouron, Texaco added.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Rockwell, Agouron, Texaco added.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber said its Private Client Group retail division added Rockwell International Corp, Agouron Pharmaceuticals Inc and Texaco Inc to its Focus List.</p>
<p>-- estimates Rockwell 1997 earnings $3.55 a share, compared to $3.11 in 1996.</p>
<p>-- estimates Agouron 1997 earnings $2.76 a share, compared to $1.98 in 1996.</p>
<p>-- estimates Texaco 1997 earnings $7.05 a share, compared to $6.37 in 1996.</p>
</text>
